      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right that the world won't change just because you get help—but your *perspective* and your *capacity* to handle it can. The treadmill doesn't have to be your only option; you can learn to step off, set boundaries, and find spaces where you don't have to perform. Feeling fundamentally broken is a heavy, painful belief, but it's not the same as being broken—it's a sign of how much you've been carrying. Please don't give up on yourself before giving yourself the chance to see what a different kind of life could feel like.",
